### Result
- [Screenshot of Enrollment section showing Actual Enrollment count](enrollment_count.png)
### Ran Playwright code
```js
// Screenshot Enrollment section showing Actual Enrollment count and save it as enrollment_count.png
await page.getByText('Enrollment (Actual) 90').screenshot({
path: 'enrollment_count.png',
  scale: 'css',
  type: 'png'
});
```

function.arguments:
{"function": "() => {
  const bodyText = document.body.innerText;
  const matches = bodyText.match(/Estimated Enrollment|Planned Enrollment|Enrollment.*\d+/g);
  return matches ? matches.slice(0, 10) : 'No matches';
}"}

